    <div class="grey-policy__content rte">
      <div class="grey-policy__intro">
        <p>Grey Exim (&ldquo;Grey Exim&rdquo;, &ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo; or &ldquo;our&rdquo;) respects your privacy and is committed to handling your personal data responsibly, securely and transparently.</p>
        <p>Grey Exim operates the ecommerce website <a href="https://www.greyexim.com">www.greyexim.com</a> and offers fashion and lifestyle products including scarves, bandanas, Indo-Western tops, jewellery and related products.</p>
        <p>This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, process, share, store and protect your personal data when you visit our website, create an account, place an order, subscribe to marketing communications, contact us or otherwise interact with Grey Exim.</p>
        <p>By providing personal data to us or using our website, you acknowledge that you have received and reviewed this Privacy Policy. Where your consent is required under applicable law, we will seek it separately and appropriately.</p>
      </div>

